# What `gcloud builds submit` (production deploy, ~/claude-helpers/deploy.sh) uploads to the build bucket and
# puts into the image. Same as the default gcloud generates (git's ignore rules), plus working material that
# isn't part of the app. content/ (help pages) must stay: src/lib/help-content.ts reads it at runtime.
.gcloudignore
.git
.gitignore
#!include:.gitignore
/docs/
/export/
/Claude outputs/
*.tsbuildinfo
# Patterns start with / so they only match at the repo root (src/app/api/**/export/ routes must stay).
